<page-meta page-style="{{showReturnModal ? 'overflow: hidden;' : ''}}"></page-meta>
<view class="container barrel-assets-page">
  <asset-station-view compact="{{true}}" id="asset-station-view" station-id="{{viewStationId}}" station-name="{{stationName}}" status-text="{{viewStationStatusText}}" order-station-name="{{orderStationName}}" busy="{{submitting || recoveringPurchase}}" bind:change="onAssetStationChange" />
  <loading wx:if="{{loading}}"></loading>

  <block wx:else>
    <text class="stale-note" wx:if="{{refreshing}}">正在重新核对，以下为上次读取的信息…</text>
    <text class="stale-note" wx:if="{{summaryStale || holdingsStale || recordsStale}}">部分内容未更新，以下保留上次读取的信息；相关退还操作需重新核对后办理。</text>
    <!-- [2026-09-20] 部分桶接口失败时的提示：没有它，失败渲染出来的「权益 0 · 占用 0」
         与"确实没有桶"长得一模一样（loadError 为空串时不渲染）。 -->
    <view class="load-error" wx:if="{{loadError}}">{{loadError}}<view wx:if="{{!needLogin}}" bindtap="onRetryAssets">重新加载 ›</view></view>
    <view class="load-error" wx:if="{{returnRecoveryError}}">{{returnRecoveryError}}<view bindtap="onRetryAssets">重新读取原凭据 ›</view></view>
    <view class="load-error" wx:if="{{pendingReturn}}">本站有一笔原退还申请结果待核实，核实前请勿另发申请。<button class="af-action af-action--secondary" bindtap="onShowReturnModal" disabled="{{submitting}}">核对原申请</button></view>
    <view class="ui-draft-notice" wx:if="{{uiDraftAvailable || uiDraftError}}"><text>{{uiDraftError || '有一份未提交的退还填写'}}</text><button class="af-action af-action--quiet" wx:if="{{uiDraftAvailable}}" bindtap="onRestoreUiDraft" disabled="{{submitting || pendingReturn || returnRecoveryError}}"><text class="af-action__face">恢复暂存填写</text></button><button class="af-action af-action--quiet" wx:else bindtap="readUiDraft"><text class="af-action__face">重试读取暂存</text></button></view>
    <button class="af-action af-action--secondary" wx:if="{{needLogin}}" bindtap="onLogin">去登录</button>
    <button class="af-action af-action--secondary" wx:if="{{!needLogin && !viewStationId}}" bindtap="onChooseAssetStation">选择资产水站</button>

    <!-- 当前水站：桶权益与押金按「客户 × 水站」隔离。不写清楚，客户换个站会以为桶/押金丢了。
         文案与样式照抄 pages/deposit/records（同一条提示条，保持一致）。 -->
    <view class="stats-card" wx:if="{{summary}}">
      <view class="stat-col stat-physical">
        <text class="stat-label">{{summary.independentRights ? '用桶权益' : '桶账汇总'}}</text>
        <view class="stat-value-row">
          <text class="stat-number">{{summary.independentRights ? (summary.rightBuckets == null ? '—' : summary.rightBuckets) : (summary.heldBuckets == null ? '—' : summary.heldBuckets)}}</text>
          <text class="stat-unit">{{summary.independentRights ? '份' : '个'}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="stat-link" wx:if="{{summary.independentRights && summary.availableRights != null}}">当前可用 {{summary.availableRights}} 份</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat-divider"></view>
      <view class="stat-col stat-money" bindtap="onDepositRecords">
        <!--
          「押金余额」不是「押金」也不是「可退押金」（docs/design/29 §7）：
          这个数是 customer_deposit_account.balance，回答"现在账上还有多少"，
          退桶能拿回多少要看退桶预览的「本次可退」（后端按押金条批次 FIFO 算），两者不是一个数。
          ⚠️ 也**不许**写成"现在即可退"—— 余额里有配送中桶的预收部分，当下退不出来。
        -->
        <text class="stat-label">押金余额</text>
        <view class="stat-value-row">
          <text class="stat-number deposit">{{summary.depositBalance == null ? '—' : '¥' + summary.depositBalance}}</text>
        </view>
        <!-- 余额只回答"现在多少"，流水才回答"为什么变"（退桶/丢桶赔偿/调整都只在这里看得见） -->
        <text class="stat-link">押金流水 ›</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat-divider"></view>
      <view class="stat-col {{summary.owedBuckets > 0 ? 'stat-owed' : 'stat-neutral'}}">
        <text class="stat-label">欠桶</text>
        <view class="stat-value-row">
          <text class="stat-number {{summary.owedBuckets > 0 ? 'owed' : ''}}">{{summary.owedBuckets == null ? '—' : summary.owedBuckets}}</text>
          <text class="stat-unit">个</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="rights-actions" wx:if="{{summary.independentRights}}">
      <button class="af-action af-action--primary rights-purchase" bindtap="onPurchaseRights"><icon name="wallet" size="22px" color="#FFFFFF" /><text>交桶押金</text></button>
      <text class="rights-purchase-note">不含水费</text>
    </view>

    <view class="owed-tip" wx:if="{{summary.owedBuckets > 0}}">
      <text>欠桶 {{summary.owedBuckets}} 个：不影响下单；退桶前需先还清对应商品的欠桶</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 2026-10-24：暂存与未领都可能形成账面余额，不能一概说成已经多还的实物。 -->
    <view class="storage-tip" wx:if="{{summary.storageBuckets > 0 && !summary.independentRights}}">
      <text>暂存或待领取记录：{{summary.storageBuckets}} 个，实际交接请向资产水站确认。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-header">
        <!--
          [2026-09-27 走查 C07 修] 原标题「长期桶资产（按商品聚合）」是**建模语言**
          （"资产"是表名口径："按商品聚合"是实现方式），顾客不需要知道系统怎么存的。
          顾客要回答的是"我有哪些桶、几个、能不能退" —— 换成「我的水桶」，一句人话。
          ⚠️ 只改标题与空态文案：分组口径（`customerBarrelAsset` 由后端下发）、
             数量与"押金 ¥X/桶"一律没动。
        -->
        <text class="section-title">我的水桶</text>
        <view class="af-action af-action--quiet barrel-return-entry" bindtap="onShowReturnModal" wx:if="{{maxReturnQty > 0 && !refreshing && !summaryFailed && !holdingsFailed}}">
          <!-- [2026-10-10] 未领权益也可退出；申请标题不把所有权益说成已领取实物。 -->
          <text class="af-action__face">{{summary.independentRights ? '退还权益' : '申请退桶'}} ›</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="bucket-list" wx:if="{{customerBarrelAsset.length > 0}}">
        <view class="bucket-item asset-bucket-item" wx:for="{{customerBarrelAsset}}" wx:key="productId">
          <view class="bucket-info">
            <image class="asset-product-photo" wx:if="{{item.assetImageUrl && !item.assetImageFailed}}" src="{{item.assetImageUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="onAssetPhotoError" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-src="{{item.assetImageUrl}}" />
            <view class="asset-product-photo asset-photo-placeholder" wx:else><icon name="barrel" size="40px" color="#387A78" /></view>
            <view class="bucket-detail">
              <text class="bucket-id">{{item.productName || '商品名称待确认'}}</text><text class="bucket-spec">{{item.displaySpec}}</text>
              <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{!item.independentRights}}">水桶记录 {{item.heldTotalQty}} 桶<text wx:if="{{item.inTransitQty > 0}}">（含此前配送中 {{item.inTransitQty}} 桶）</text> · 欠桶 {{item.owedQty}} 桶</text>
              <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{item.independentRights}}">有效权益 {{item.assetQty}} 份 · 当前可用 {{item.availableRights}} 份</text>
              <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{item.storageQty != null && item.storageQty > 0}}">暂存或待领取 {{item.storageQty}} 个（实际交接请向水站确认）</text>
              <text class="asset-deposit-standard">{{item.deposit == null ? '每桶押金待确认' : '每桶押金标准 ¥' + item.deposit}}</text>
              <view class="bucket-detail-toggle" data-id="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="onToggleBarrelDetail" hover-class="bucket-detail-pressed">{{expandedProductId === item.productId ? '收起明细' : '查看桶账明细'}} ›</view>
              <view class="bucket-account-detail" wx:if="{{expandedProductId === item.productId}}">
                <text>水桶记录 {{item.occupiedQty}} 个 · 欠桶 {{item.owedQty}} 个</text>
                <text>以上数量根据押金与借还记录汇总，实际交接请向水站确认。</text>
                <text wx:if="{{item.independentRights}}">当前可用权益已扣除订单及退还等占用。</text>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>

        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 空态：原文「暂无长期桶资产」同样是建模语言；改成顾客视角的一句话 -->
      <view class="local-empty" wx:elif="{{holdingsFailed}}"><text>商品桶账暂未加载，请重新加载</text></view>
      <view class="local-empty" wx:else>
        <view class="empty-barrel-icon"><icon name="barrel" size="38px" color="#1264D6" /></view>
        <text>该站暂无桶账记录</text>
        <block wx:if="{{!needLogin && viewStationId && !summaryFailed && !refreshing && !loadError}}">
          <text class="empty-next-note">订水使用当前下单水站{{orderStationName ? '（' + orderStationName + '）' : '，请在订水页确认'}}；查看资产不会更改下单水站。</text>
          <view class="empty-actions">
            <button wx:if="{{hasOtherAssetStation}}" class="af-action af-action--primary" bindtap="onChooseAssetStation">切换资产水站</button>
            <button class="af-action af-action--secondary" bindtap="onGoOrderHome">去订水</button>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-header">
        <text class="section-title">办理与历史记录</text>
        <button class="af-action af-action--quiet" bindtap="onToggleRecords"><text class="af-action__face">{{showAllRecords ? '收起历史' : '查看全部'}}</text></button>
      </view>
      <text class="local-empty" wx:if="{{!showAllRecords && !processingRecordsCount && !recordsFailed}}">当前没有待办理记录，可查看全部历史。</text>
      <view class="bucket-list" wx:if="{{records.length > 0}}">
        <view class="bucket-item barrel-record" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{showAllRecords || item.returnDetail.status === 'APPLIED' || item.returnDetail.status === 'APPROVED' || item.returnDetail.status === 'RECEIVED' || item.refundProgress.remaining > 0 || item.refundProgress.verified === false || (item.type === 2 && !item.returnDetail && item.status !== 3 && item.status !== 4)}}">
          <view class="record-header">
            <view class="bucket-info">
              <view class="bucket-icon"><icon name="barrel" size="40rpx" color="#1677FF" /></view>
              <view class="bucket-detail">
                <!-- ⚠️ BarrelRecord 没有 barrelNo 字段，原写法 item.barrelNo || ('桶号 #' + item.id)
                     永远走兜底分支，把流水主键当成"桶号"报给客户（假桶号）。
                     类型/数量/备注后端都已下发（typeText/quantity/note），照实展示即可。 -->
                <text class="bucket-id">{{item.typeText || '类型未提供'}}<text wx:if="{{item.quantity > 0}}"> · {{item.quantity}} 桶</text></text>
                <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{item.type === 2}}">{{item.returnIdentityText}}</text>
                <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{item.type === 2 && item.returnProductName}}">商品：{{item.returnProductName}}</text>
                <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</text>
                <text class="bucket-time" wx:if="{{item.createTime}}">{{item.createTime}}</text>
              </view>
            </view>
            <!-- statusText 只对退桶申请（type=2）有值，其余类型后端不下发（见 BarrelRecord.getStatusText） -->
            <view class="bucket-status status-{{item.status || 0}}" wx:if="{{item.statusText}}">
              <text>{{item.statusText}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text class="record-summary refund-fact" wx:if="{{item.type === 2 && item.depositRefund !== undefined && item.depositRefund !== null}}">应退押金：¥{{item.depositRefund}}（实际收到情况请核实）</text>
          <text class="record-summary refund-fact" wx:if="{{item.refundProgress && item.refundProgress.verified !== false}}">水站已登记实退 ¥{{item.refundProgress.paid}} · 剩余待退 ¥{{item.refundProgress.remaining}}。待退部分保留在原申请中。</text>
          <text class="record-summary refund-fact" wx:if="{{item.refundProgress && item.refundProgress.verified === false}}">水站已登记实退 ¥{{item.refundProgress.paid}}；原申请金额与待退责任仍待核实，记录保留，请联系原水站。</text>
          <view class="record-return" wx:if="{{item.returnDetail}}">
            <text class="record-summary">{{item.returnDetail.pickupModeText}} · 应交回 {{item.returnDetail.requiredBarrels}} 桶 · 取桶费 ¥{{item.returnDetail.pickupFee}}</text>
            <text class="record-summary">{{item.returnDetail.statusText}}</text>
            <text class="record-summary" wx:if="{{item.returnDetail.companionOrderId}}">关联送水单 #{{item.returnDetail.companionOrderId}}</text>
            <text class="record-summary" wx:if="{{item.returnDetail.arrangementRequiresConfirmation && !item.returnDetail.customerConfirmationCurrent}}">水站提出了新的收桶安排，请核对后决定是否同意；也可更改或撤回申请。</text>
            <view class="record-actions">
              <!-- 2026-10-27：旧记录刷新时处理器会拒绝确认，按钮也必须同步禁用。 -->
              <button class="af-action af-action--primary" wx:if="{{item.returnDetail.status === 'APPROVED' && item.returnDetail.customerConfirmationRequired !== false && !item.returnDetail.customerConfirmationCurrent}}" disabled="{{refreshing || recordsFailed}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onReturnConfirm">确认费用或新安排</button>
              <button class="af-action af-action--secondary" disabled="{{refreshing || recordsFailed}}" wx:if="{{item.returnDetail.status === 'APPLIED' || item.returnDetail.status === 'APPROVED'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onReturnArrangement">更改收桶安排</button>
              <button class="af-action af-action--danger-quiet" disabled="{{refreshing || recordsFailed}}" wx:if="{{item.returnDetail.status === 'APPLIED' || item.returnDetail.status === 'APPROVED'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onReturnWithdraw">撤回申请</button>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text class="record-summary refund-fact" wx:if="{{item.statusText && item.refundPaidTime}}">水站登记退款交付时间：{{item.refundPaidTime}}。如实际未收到，请联系退款水站核实。</text>
          <text class="record-summary" wx:if="{{item.statusText && item.handleNote}}">处理说明：{{item.handleNote}}</text>
          <button class="af-action af-action--quiet" wx:if="{{item.statusText}}" bindtap="onRefundFeedback" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text class="af-action__face">异议或补充说明</text></button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="local-empty" wx:elif="{{recordsFailed}}"><text>水桶记录暂未加载，请重新加载</text></view>
      <view class="local-empty" wx:elif="{{showAllRecords || processingRecordsCount}}"><text>该站暂无水桶记录</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="info-card">
      <view class="info-row" wx:if="{{summary.depositPerBucket > 0}}">
        <text class="info-label">最近一次每桶押金</text>
        <text class="info-value">¥{{summary.depositPerBucket}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-tip">
        <text>不同商品的押金不同，申请前可查看预计金额；水站核实退桶或未领桶权益后处理退款</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="barrel-rules-link" bindtap="onEcoRuleTap" aria-role="button">退还规则 ›</view>
  </block>

  <view class="modal-mask" wx:if="{{showReturnModal}}" bindtap="onCloseReturnModal"></view>
  <view class="modal-content {{showReturnModal ? 'show' : ''}}" catchtap="">
    <view class="modal-header">
      <text class="modal-title">{{pendingReturn ? '核对原退还申请' : (summary.independentRights ? '申请退还权益' : '申请退桶')}}</text>
      <text class="modal-close" bindtap="onCloseReturnModal">×</text>
    </view>

    <view class="modal-body">
      <view class="load-error" wx:if="{{returnError}}">{{returnError}}</view>
      <view class="return-tip"><text>办理水站：{{stationName || '水站 #' + viewStationId}}</text>

        <!-- [2026-10-10] 新模型的上限是可退权益，原固定“桶”会把已付未领容量说成实物；只切换单位，数量/押金试算不变。 -->
        <text wx:if="{{pendingReturn}}">原申请：{{pendingReturnProductText || '商品编号：' + pendingReturn.body.productId}}，数量 {{pendingReturn.body.quantity}}；原内容与编号已保留</text>
        <text wx:elif="{{!loading && !refreshing && !summaryFailed && !holdingsFailed}}">当前可退 <text class="highlight">{{maxReturnQty}}</text> {{summary.independentRights ? '份权益' : '桶'}}</text>
        <text wx:else>当前可退数量尚未核实，请重新加载。</text>
      </view>

      <view class="form-row" wx:if="{{returnProductOptions.length > 0}}">
        <text class="form-label">商品</text>
        <product-selector items="{{returnProductOptions}}" selected-id="{{returnForm.productId}}" disabled="{{submitting || pendingReturn || returnRecoveryError}}" bind:change="onReturnProductSelect" />
      </view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">{{summary.independentRights ? '退还权益数量' : '退桶数量'}}</text>
        <integer-stepper value="{{returnForm.quantity}}" min="{{1}}" max="{{maxReturnQty}}" label="退还数量" disabled="{{submitting || pendingReturn || returnRecoveryError}}" bind:change="onReturnQtyInput" />
      </view>

      <!-- 退款金额由后端按押金条批次 FIFO 核销算出，顾客不能自己填 -->
      <text class="quantity-error" wx:if="{{returnQuantityError}}">{{returnQuantityError}}</text>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">预计退回</text>
        <view class="preview-row" bindtap="refreshPreview">
          <text class="preview-placeholder" wx:if="{{previewing}}">计算中...</text>
          <text class="preview-amount" wx:elif="{{previewReady && preview && !preview.blocked}}">¥{{preview.refundAmount}}</text>
          <text class="preview-placeholder" wx:else>{{previewHint || '请选择商品和数量'}} · 点击重新试算</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <!--
        算不出来的**原因**要常驻显示，不能只弹一次 toast：
        最典型是「还没选服务水站」（试算必须带 waterStationId，后端只认请求参数）。
        以前这里失败被静默吞掉，顾客看到的是一个空白金额框，与「后端算不出」分不清。
      -->
      <view class="preview-hint" wx:if="{{previewHint}}">
        <text>{{previewHint}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="preview-hint" wx:if="{{previewReady && preview && !preview.blocked && preview.frozenRefundAmount > 0}}">
        <text>本商品争议范围内暂留 ¥{{preview.frozenRefundAmount}}；交接后当前可办理 ¥{{preview.availableRefundAmount}}。暂留部分仍属待退责任，不代表已退款或扣款。</text>
      </view>

      <view class="preview-blocked" wx:if="{{preview && preview.blocked}}">
        <text>{{preview.blockedReason}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="preview-lots" wx:if="{{preview && preview.lots.length > 0}}">
        <button class="af-action af-action--quiet" bindtap="onTogglePreviewLots"><text class="af-action__face">{{showPreviewLots ? '收起金额明细' : '查看预计金额明细'}}</text></button>
        <view class="preview-lot" wx:for="{{preview.lots}}" wx:key="lotId" wx:if="{{showPreviewLots}}">
          <text>{{item.qty}} 个 × ¥{{item.unitPrice}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="preview-warn" wx:if="{{preview && preview.hasMigratedPrice}}">
        <text>含历史推断单价，实际金额请与水站确认</text>
      </view>

      <view class="preview-storage" wx:if="{{preview && preview.storageQty > 0}}">
        <text>{{summary.independentRights ? '另有待领取或暂存容量' : '另有空桶寄存在水站'}} {{preview.storageQty}} 个；本次应交桶数量以批准安排为准</text>
      </view>

      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">备注</text>
        <input class="note-input" placeholder="如：搬家、换地址等" value="{{returnForm.note}}" bindinput="onReturnNoteInput" disabled="{{submitting || pendingReturn}}"></input>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row" wx:if="{{summary.independentRights}}" bindtap="onPickupMode"><text>交接方式：{{returnForm.pickupModeText || '到店办理'}} ›</text></view>
      <!-- [2026-10-09] 原提示把免费原安排也说成必须确认，与已有办理闸门相矛盾；
           只同步提示，确认条件见 docs/design/35，保留原样式和事件。 -->
      <button class="af-action af-action--quiet" wx:if="{{summary.independentRights}}" bindtap="onToggleReturnRules"><text class="af-action__face">{{showReturnRules ? '收起办理规则' : '查看办理规则'}}</text></button>
      <view class="preview-hint" wx:if="{{summary.independentRights && showReturnRules}}"><text>先申请批准；免费原安排无需再次确认，收费或水站新安排须先确认。未领桶的权益也可申请退还；仅退还当前未被订单占用的权益。需交回的实物桶仍按批准安排交回，交回数量及费用以原安排为准。</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="modal-footer">
      <view class="af-action af-action--cancel af-action--form" bindtap="onCloseReturnModal">
        <text>取消</text>
      </view>
      <view class="af-action af-action--primary af-action--form af-action--grow {{submitting || (!pendingReturn && (loading || refreshing || summaryFailed || holdingsFailed || previewing || !previewReady)) ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmitReturn">
        <text>{{submitting ? '提交中...' : (pendingReturn ? '原样重试' : '提交申请')}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<business-dialog id="business-dialog" />
